---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecDB as Execution DBs

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run status
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Parse run id
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Load authoritative run row
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Run snapshot

    alt Run loaded
        alt Run is creating or failed during creation
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Read placement seed progress and latest error
            ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Control-only creation progress
        else Run was activated
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Load execution routes
            Vigilo->>ExecDB: Read routed shard summaries in one batch per database
            ExecDB-->>Vigilo: Live progress summaries
        end
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Mark whether status is terminal
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build status payload with creation or live progress
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Run lookup fails
        Vigilo-->>User: Status error
    end
    deactivate Vigilo
